							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;"><b>Thursday July 19 </b>- Blue Scholars in the Music Lounge - live performance&nbsp; - TODAY <br />The Blue Scholars will be making an appearance on-line in the Music Lounge on Thursday July 19th from 4PM-5PM PST. Come hang out with Geo and Sabzi, ask them questions, listen to MassLine music, and hang out with other fans. For more information visit the Lounge at <a href="http&#58;//www.themusiclounge.com" target="_blank">www.themusiclounge.com</a>.&nbsp; (this is a sort of Second Life meets MySpace space - it&#039;s pretty great - should feature it on the front of the Rawkus site - go to the website to check it out)<br /><br /><b>Thursday July 19</b> - 7:30 pm - <b>live interview on KALX in Berkeley</b> - with DJ Queen Bee - <a href="http&#58;//kalx.berkeley.edu/" target="_blank">http://kalx.berkeley.edu/</a><br /><br /><b>Saturday July 21</b> - Blue Scholars and United Players Presents: &quot;silence the violence&quot; with Gorilla Savages, Hustle Boys, Blue Scholars, with special appearances by Geneo and Donte<br />Hosted by the Original Gorilla Pino Big Rudd, Doors at 3pm, All Ages :: FREE<br />Gene Friend (SOMA) Recreation Center<br />270th 6th Street<br /><b>San Francisco,</b> Ca 94103<br />On the corner of 6th and Folson <br /><br /><b>Sunday July 22 - interview on KUSF 90.3 FM</b>, San Francisco streaming live at <a href="http&#58;//www.KUSF.org" target="_blank">www.KUSF.org</a><br /><br /><b>Sunday July 22 </b>- Blue Scholars with Mr. J, Jern Eye, <br />Cafe du Nord<br />2170 Market Street<br /><b>San Francisco</b>, CA 94114<br />7:00 pm :: All Ages :: &#036;10<br /><br /><b>Monday July 23 </b>- LA Phillipine Consulate Protest&nbsp; - 5:00 pm - Blue Scholars performance at rally for Phillipine State of the Nation address<br /><br /><b>Monday JUL 23rd</b>&nbsp; The Procussions present MR.J.MEDEIROS&nbsp; &quot;Of gods and girls&quot;&nbsp; ALBUM RELEASE PARTY Knitting Factory 7021 Hollywood Blvd, <b>Los Angeles</b><br />Performances by: THE PROCUSSIONS, MR. J MEDEIROS, BLUE SCHOLARS ,&nbsp; DJ VAJRA, DJ inka one,&nbsp; Special Guests TBA,&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />18+ / &#036;10 /&nbsp; 9PM Doors / 10PM Blue Scholars / 11PM Procussions <br /><br /><b>Sunday August 5&nbsp; </b>Anak Bayan NY/NJ and FIRE (filipinas for rights and empowerment) Present:<br />Big Things Poppin&#039; - Party Like ARAK star!<br />8PM-1AM ::&nbsp; &#036;10&nbsp; ALL AGES<br />BLUE SCHOLARS, Kiwi from Native Guns, Kadena, Koba, Hanalei, Deep Foundation, Mike Swift, Bleud<br />... and many others!<br />Terraza Cafe<br />40-19 Gleane St.<br />Jackson Heights, NY 11373<br /><br /><b>Tuesday August 7&nbsp; &nbsp;</b>Pinoy Apparel presents BLUE SCHOLARS , DJ Virus (ITF Vet/BattleStar SD) , DJ Rampage (Playtime Attractions SD) &amp; DJ DonRyan (Electric Shockers, Jungle Riddim SD) <br />LEADERSHIP CREW (Oxnard, CA) , PRIMETIME SPECIALISTS: Son of Ran (SF/SD), Cypher Optics (LA/SD) &amp; DJ Virus (SD)<br />Kava Lounge&nbsp; 2812 Kettner Blvd., <b> San Diego</b><br />&#036;5 at the door :: 21+&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href="http&#58;//www.kavalounge.com" target="_blank">www.kavalounge.com</a> , <a href="http&#58;//www.pinoyapparel.com" target="_blank">www.pinoyapparel.com</a> <br /><br /><b>Wednesday August 8</b> Wed August 8th, BLUE SCHOLARS -&nbsp; <br />Knitting Factory&nbsp; 7021 Hollywood Blvd. <b> Los Angeles</b>, CA&nbsp; &nbsp;8:00 pm :: &#036;11/ &#036;13<br /><br /><b>Thursday August 23</b>&nbsp; Matisyahu, Blue Scholars - House of Blues 3950 Las Vegas Blvd, <b>Las Vegas</b><br />7:00 pm :: All Ages <br /><br /><b>Saturday August 25 </b>- Matisyahu, Blue Scholars - Catalyst&nbsp; 1011 Pacific Ave, <b>Santa Cruz </b> <br />9:00 pm :: All Ages<br /><br /><b>Thursday August 30</b> - Matisyahu, Blue Scholars - Athletic Club of Bend&nbsp; 61615 Mt Bachelor, Dr&nbsp; <b>Bend Oregon</b><br />6:30 pm :: All Ages</div>
